This repository packages one coding task built on rq (https://github.com/rq/rq).

- The rq source code included in the task images (environment/rq-src.tar.gz, tests/rq-src.tar.gz) and the reference patch to it are under rq's licence, BSD-2-Clause, reproduced below.
- The task text, grader and packaging are copyright 2026 Sriya Jonnadula.

